## Guidelines
- Set `lang` and `dir` on the document and propagate direction to portaled menus.
- Prefer logical CSS: `padding-inline-start` instead of `padding-left`.

```css
/* Prefer */
inset-inline-end: 0;
text-align: start;
```
- Isolate mixed-direction text with `dir="auto"` or `<bdi>`.
- Do not assume LTR scrolling: RTL `scrollLeft` can be negative.
